chat.example_ad:
【MailFlow · Ordinary mail】
[{urgency}] {subject}
From: {sender}
Ordinary mail is delivered as well and is not filtered out; send feedback if a category is incorrect.

chat.example_reminder:
【MailFlow · Schedule reminder】
"{summary}" is due soon
Due: {due}

chat.manual_mail:
【MailFlow · Mail】
{cmd_list}
  list recent mail; add --query <keyword> to filter by subject or body
{cmd_show}
  show a mail's summary, sender and attachments
{cmd_urgency}
  set a manual level: ad / info / important / urgent; auto restores the automatic result
{cmd_delete}
  move a mail to the trash; it can be restored at any time
{cmd_feedback}
  reject a mail and state the reason, e.g. {ex_feedback}
  similar mail will be classified correctly afterwards

